<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113498" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαυνότης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>porousness, sponginess,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς γῆς</span> interpol. in <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				19.11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάφρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pyrrh.</u>
					28
				</span></i>
			; of snow, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.649c
			</span></i>; of foam, ib.<i><span class="en">
				99b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>looseness</i> of a bandage, Gal(?). ap.<i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				46.1.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>empty conceit, vanity,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνοήτου ψυχῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					175b
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεγαλοψυχία,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1107b23
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
